IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0004.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY CRD0004C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 DECISION-CD        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM DECIDE-APPLICATION
    DISPLAY "DECISION-CD=" DECISION-CD
    STOP RUN.
DECIDE-APPLICATION.
    *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL - LIMIT 555 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 740 AND DEBT-RATIO < 0.43
        MOVE 'A' TO DECISION-CD
    ELSE
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER - LIMIT 1020 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 680
            MOVE 'R' TO DECISION-CD
        ELSE
            MOVE 'D' TO DECISION-CD
        END-IF
    END-IF.
